Provenance Notice:
This package (scripts/portable-python/rpds_wasi) is an independent pure-Python
implementation of the persistent data structure API (HashTrieMap, HashTrieSet,
List, Queue) authored by Painted Wolf Code for CPython/WASI (wasm32-wasi),
where the upstream Rust-compiled rpds-py wheel cannot be dynamically loaded.
It provides API compatibility with rpds-py for referencing and jsonschema.

